rst death, and we will not be punished?\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"37:60","t":"Indeed, this is the great attainment.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"37:61","t":"For the like of this let the workers [on earth] work.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":61,"sd":null},{"k":"37:62","t":"Is that [i.e., Paradise] a better accommodation or the tree of zaqqūm?","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"37:63","t":"Indeed, We have made it a torment for the wrongdoers.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"37:64","t":"Indeed, it is a tree issuing from the bottom of the Hellfire,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"37:65","t":"Its emerging fruit as if it was heads of the devils.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"37:66","t":"And indeed, they will eat from it and fill with it their bellies.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"37:67","t":"Then indeed, they will have after it a mixture of scalding water.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"37:68","t":"Then indeed, their return will be to the Hellfire.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"37:69","t":"Indeed they found their fathers astray.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"37:70","t":"So they hastened [to follow] in their footsteps.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":70,"sd":null},{"k":"37:71","t":"And there had already strayed before them most of the former peoples,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"37:72","t":"And We had already sent among them warners.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"37:73","t":"Then look how was the end of those who were warned -","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"37:74","t":"But not the chosen servants of Allāh.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"37:75","t":"And Noah had certainly called Us, and [We are] the best of responders.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"37:76","t":"And We saved him and his family from the great affliction.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":76,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[37],"sajdah":false}